## Interface: 16001
## Title: GaarBarsForever
## Notes: Clearer action buttons on WoW Forever: a red icon out of range, a blue icon without mana, big cooldown numbers (56, 2m, 1h; none for the global cooldown), short hotkeys (M4, N1, sc3), optional macro names, a spellbook tab of the spells missing from your bars and flyouts on any button (drop on the +). Each part can be switched off. /gbars
